# Rover 800 R17 (fastback), 1991-1999.
#
# The R17 was the November 1991 reskin of the Rover 800 XX: a new, more curvaceous
# front with the traditional Rover grille of vertical chrome bars, a new rear, and
# a longer, lower body on the unchanged structure, doors and wheelbase. It ran to
# 1999 alongside the coupe.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rover_800
# https://rover800.org.uk/the-rover-800-series/
#
# Dimensions 4.882 x 1.730 x 1.363 m, wheelbase 2.760 m. The R17 is 188 mm longer
# and 35 mm lower than the XX on the same wheelbase. The published English width of
# 1,965 mm is mirror-inclusive; the German table's 1,730 mm is the body width and
# matches the XX, so 1.730 m is used.
#
# Colours: Nightfire Red, Charcoal Grey, White Gold and Steel Blue, the same four as
# the existing Rover800 objects, so that the two marks of the family sit together on
# the road. Weights are on the same family total of 100 as those objects rather than
# this tranche's provisional 12-22 scale: red 30, grey 26, white 24, blue 20. The
# 1991-99 years have no measured colour split, so the split follows the XX's.
#
# Speed 210 km/h and comfort 110/345, both inherited from the existing Rover800
# objects so that the family is consistent. Classes 2,3.
#
# Dates are road presence, not production: November 1991 intro, retires staggered
# 2008-2012 on a seventeen- to twenty-one-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/rover-800-r17.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/rover-800-r17.dae (82 objects). Variant of the corrected Rover 800
# XX master; references: citycars/references/rover-800-r17/ (gitignored; Wikimedia
# Commons, CC BY 2.0 and CC BY-SA 2.0).
#
# Accepted low-poly deviations, recorded rather than corrected: the bumper curvature
# is angular, some corner trim is occluded, and one of the three reference
# photographs shows a saloon rather than a fastback and was used only for rear
# detail.

obj=citycar
name=Rover800R17(NightfireRed)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=30
intro_year=1991
intro_month=11
retire_year=2010
retire_month=6
speed=210
class=2,3
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=110
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=345

